aka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobrGz6m9.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob9S2cKH.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へば、またな〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(普通に日々のことを書いたブログも執筆途中で完成間近なので……ほんとにまたすぐ、会おうね。)"}],"source":"official"},"sba-sakura-50152":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日25時56分から、\nテレビ朝日「サクラミーツ」放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のゲストは、ゾフィーさんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゾフィーさん、武元、井上でコントさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はサクラミーツでは、初コントになります！\nゾフィーさんから頂いたアドバイスをもとに、全力でコントしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また皆さんの感想聞かせてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#サクラミーツで盛り上げてくださったら嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見逃し配信もしていますので、是非チェックしてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式Twitter、Instagramもありますので、フォローやいいね、よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクラミーツ、ぜひご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ13KGPH7RMNGYE9T7NDC79Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra